# Line endings: the repo stores LF everywhere. Windows checkouts with
# core.autocrlf=true were re-committing whole files as CRLF churn, which made
# doc diffs unreadable (2026-09-18). `git add --renormalize .` after changes.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
